# Build context exclusions.
#
# Without this file `COPY . .` bakes the entire working tree into the image —
# which on first run meant .env (API_KEY, INTEGRATION_SECRET, FINNHUB_API_KEY),
# the whole .git history, and 20MB of database dumps from backups/. An image is
# a distributable artefact; anything copied into it should be assumed shareable.

# ── Secrets and local config ──
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# ── Real data — never leaves this machine ──
backups/
*.dump
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls

# ── Repository and tooling state ──
.git/
.github/
.husky/
.turbo/
.claude/
.kiro/
.vscode/

# ── Build and dependency output (rebuilt inside the image) ──
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
dist/
**/dist/
coverage/
**/coverage/
**/.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Test artefacts ──
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/.playwright/

# ── Editor/OS noise ──
.DS_Store
*.log
